## Why This Is Asked
This tests advanced spatial indexing with dynamic updates and order statistics in 3D, relevant for large-scale simulations (NVIDIA) or online marketplaces with spatial constraints (Instacart, Amazon).

## Key Concepts
- 3D range trees and nested segment trees
- Weight compression and Fenwick trees for counts/sums
- Order statistics via binary search over weight indices
- Handling duplicates via multiplicities per weight index
- Fractional cascading for faster multi-node queries

## Code Example
